> db.Users.peek({limit: 2})
Error: peek failed: server error (4): peek is not defined for hash buckets: a hash has no order to take from, so there is no "next" to look at. Read one with get("<key>") or several with find(). A hash bucket takes: put, insert, insert many, get, exists, delete, update, push, find, distinct, count, search, stats, consistent get.
